# Base URL of the ParcelFlow API.
#
# "/api" routes through this origin: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the Render
# service. Keep this as the default. A direct cross-origin URL works too, but
# some ad-blocker filter lists and corporate URLBlocklist policies block
# onrender.com outright (ERR_BLOCKED_BY_CLIENT), which kills the whole app.
#
# Vite inlines VITE_* at BUILD time, not run time, so changing this on Vercel
# requires a redeploy — saving the variable alone does nothing.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
